/></a></div></div><div class="vc_item"><div class="vc_inner"><a class="" href="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w.jpg" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-8637-1696932925]"><img decoding="async" width="600" height="400" src="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w.jpg" class="attachment-full" alt="" title="clinica-59w" srcset="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w.jpg 600w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w-480x320.jpg 480w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w-390x260.jpg 390w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-59w-285x190.jpg 285w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></a></div></div><div class="vc_item"><div class="vc_inner"><a class="" href="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w.jpg" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-8637-1696932925]"><img decoding="async" width="600" height="400" src="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w.jpg" class="attachment-full" alt="" title="clinica-42w" srcset="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w.jpg 600w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w-480x320.jpg 480w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w-390x260.jpg 390w, https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-42w-285x190.jpg 285w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></a></div></div><div class="vc_item"><div class="vc_inner"><a class="" href="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/clinica-34w.jpg" data-lightbox="lightbox[rel-8637-1696932925]"><img decoding="async" width="600" height="400" src="https://www.clinicalosandes.cl/w